/A 1130 0 R
/Alt (Flowchart illustrating two processes. A: Reviews adverse event reporting from databases DEMO and REAC, narrowing from over nine million to 500 cases for analysis in clinical characteristics, signal detection, stratification, and time-to-onset.B: Literature review from English and Chinese databases starts with 3,778 articles, removing duplicates and unrelated papers, yielding five final articles after multiple exclusion criteria.)
