/A 1140 0 R
/Alt (Two tables labeled A and B depict drug analysis comparisons. Table A lists drugs with columns for sample size \(n\), Reporting Odds Ratio \(ROR\), ROR 95% Confidence Interval, and graphical representation of ROR. Table B lists the same drugs with columns for Proportional Reporting Ratio \(PRR\), PRR 95% Confidence Interval, and corresponding plot. Gemtuzumab ozogamicin and sacituzumab govitecan show the highest ROR and PRR values, respectively, with plotted bars illustrating confidence intervals. A red dashed line serves as a reference point.)
/K [16 1141 0 R]
/P 101 0 R
/Pg 43 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 2)
/Type /StructElem
