<<
/A 1259 0 R
/Alt (Forest plot illustrating odds ratios for subgroup analyses of two sets of studies, labeled A and B. Both plot comparisons involve conditions: breast cancer, urothelial carcinoma, and non-small cell lung cancer. The odds ratio, confidence intervals, and weights are displayed for each study. The overall effect favors the experimental group in both sets, with diamonds indicating pooled estimates. Statistical heterogeneity tests are also provided, showing variability in outcomes across studies.)
